# This folder holds the local, per-maker Plan authored by the /planner skill:
#   plan.json               the structured Plan (source of truth)
#   ESS-scenario-plan.md    the editable human-readable view (reconciled back to plan.json)
#   research-context.json   cached Learn-research corpus
# These are runtime state and are git-ignored (see .gitignore). This .gitkeep
# keeps the directory in the repo so the skill has somewhere to write.
